<section class="chapter" id="decision-3"><p class="chapter-index">03 / DECISION</p><div><h2>Validate and support implementation</h2><p class="decision-summary">Validate flows and make interaction behaviour explicit for implementation.</p><details class="decision-context"><summary>Read the decision context <span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>High-fidelity prototypes used the global Design System, with adaptations for product needs. The original case documents at least five usability sessions per feature and task feedback on a seven-point scale. Figma handoff covered interaction triggers, states, microinteractions and loading behaviour.</p></details><blockquote>The feedback loop continued through validation and the details developers needed to build.</blockquote></div></section>
